Fernado Sor Opus 6, No 4

See sor_op6_no11.txt for more notes on file format.

Tab data here has been verified against these PDFs:
https://www.thisisclassicalguitar.com/fernando-sor-studies-free-sheet-music-pdfs/

Which is different from IMSLP version here in measures 9, 13, and 14.
https://imslp.org/wiki/12_Etudes,_Op.6_(Sor,_Fernando)

I chose the current version because it sounds more consistent.  To use
the IMSLP version, set use_alternative_version below to 1.
